{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31365","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼见寄 · 李续","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早年登此楼，退想不胜愁。\n地远二千里，时将四十秋。\n邅迍多失路，华皓任虚舟。\n诗酒虽堪使，何因得共游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李续","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}